        "name": "Bunston",
        "username": "Bunston",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/bunston/{size}/1939_2.png",
        "created_at": "2017-08-06T15:53:17.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I've found Lightning and River to be a stellar pair. River's ability to grant energy based on card plays allows Lightning to have several explosive turns in a row and Lightning's ability to allow River to push invaders Fast is phenomenal at clearing out the center of the island early on. Also, they can both spread across the island very quickly, which is always useful.</p>",
